| **A.2 Portfolio Theory & Markowitz Construction** | `[CORE]` | Quadratic programming, convex sets, linear algebra | Vectorized Markowitz solver using CVXPY; analytical 2-asset baseline; efficient frontier generator | Historical multi-asset daily return matrix (10–30 assets) | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` KKT optimality residuals $\le 10^{-6}$; `[MATH_INVARIANT]` analytical 2-asset match $< 10^{-7}$ | `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` In-sample vs out-of-sample Sharpe ratio, portfolio turnover | `efficient_frontier_plot.png`, `markowitz_kkt_log.json` |
| **A.3 Risk Measures & Coherent Risk Metrics** | `[CORE]` | Order statistics, coherent risk axioms (Artzner 1999), quantile estimation | Historical VaR, Parametric Gaussian VaR, Monte Carlo VaR, Expected Shortfall (CVaR) | Historical daily returns & synthetic heavy-tailed distributions | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` Subadditivity: $\text{CVaR}(X+Y) \le \text{CVaR}(X) + \text{CVaR}(Y)$; `[MATH_INVARIANT]` Monotonicity | `[EMP_HYPOTHESIS]` Kupiec POF and Christoffersen independence tests on market returns | `risk_measures_summary.json`, `var_backtest_report.md` |
| **A.4 Black-Scholes Analytical Pricing & Greeks** | `[CORE]` | Geometric Brownian Motion, Itô's lemma, parabolic PDE analytical solution | Vectorized closed-form pricing engine for European call/put options; analytical first/second order Greeks | Spot price $S$, strike $K$, risk-free rate $r$, time-to-expiry $T$, volatility $\sigma$ | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` Put-Call Parity: $|C - P - (S - K e^{-rT})| < 10^{-12}$; `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` Greek consistency $< 10^{-4}$ | Analytical Greek consistency across strike and maturity grids | `test_black_scholes.py`, `greeks_surface_plots.png` |
| **A.5 Monte Carlo Option Pricing Engine** | `[CORE]` | Law of Large Numbers, Central Limit Theorem, Euler-Maruyama discretization | Vectorized Monte Carlo path generator across strike grids; discounted terminal payoff expectation | Calibrated risk-neutral parameters $(S_0, r, \sigma, T)$; synthetic paths | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` Repeated 99% CI coverage in exact binomial band with $\alpha_{\text{fail}}=10^{-3}$; `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` error slope | Log-log error convergence rate verification ($\text{RMSE} \propto N^{-0.5}$) | `mc_convergence_curve.png`, `pricing_ci_table.json` |
