### Domain B: Probability and Stochastic Mathematics (Phase 1 [CORE] & Phase 4 [CORE])

| Topic ID & Submodule | Class | Mathematical Prerequisites | Implementation Approach | Data Requirements & Provenance | Acceptance Tests & Benchmarks | Scientific Evaluation & Metrics | Final Evidence Artifacts |
