| **B.1 Probability Distributions & Inference** | `[CORE]` | Parametric density functions, Maximum Likelihood Estimation, hypothesis testing | SciPy-based parametric fitting for Gaussian, Student's t, Log-normal, and Pareto distributions | Synthetic random variates and empirical market return series | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` KS-test on known synthetic data yields $p > 0.05$; MLE parameter recovery | Akaike Information Criterion (AIC), Bayesian Information Criterion (BIC) | `distribution_fit_qq_plots.png`, `mle_parameter_estimates.json` |
| **B.2 Brownian Motion & Quadratic Variation** | `[CORE]` | Wiener process axioms, Gaussian increments, path continuity | Discrete-time random walk approximation to standard Brownian motion $W_t$ and GBM | Synthetic pseudorandom number generators (NumPy PCG64 from SeedSequence) | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` Increments test (mean, variance, correlation within 3 SEs); `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` $\sum (\Delta W_i)^2 \xrightarrow{L^2} T$ | Pathwise variance scaling across temporal resolutions | `quadratic_variation_convergence.png`, `test_brownian_motion.py` |
| **B.3 Stochastic Differential Equations (SDEs)** | `[CORE]` | Stochastic Taylor expansion, Itô-Taylor schemes | Euler-Maruyama and Milstein numerical solvers for 1D autonomous GBM and OU processes | Synthetic SDE path parameters $(\mu, \sigma, \theta)$ | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` Milstein error slope $\in [0.90, 1.10]$, Euler slope $\in [0.45, 0.55]$; `[STAT_VALIDATION]` deterministic weak moment $\mathcal{O}(h)$ | Strong and weak convergence error curves vs step size $\Delta t$ | `sde_convergence_loglog.png`, `sde_benchmark_results.json` |
| **B.4 Stochastic Calculus & Itô's Lemma** | `[CORE]` | Stochastic integration, Itô isometry, quadratic covariation | Numerical evaluation of Itô integrals $I_{\text{discrete}} = \sum W_{t_k} \Delta W_k$ and verification of $d(\ln S_t)$ | Synthetic Wiener paths | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` Pathwise identity holds within $10 \epsilon_{\text{mach}} M$; `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` $L^2$ RMS error scales as $\sqrt{T \Delta t / 2}$ with slope SE $\le 0.05$ | Pathwise difference between Itô and ordinary Riemann-Stieltjes integrals | `ito_lemma_validation_report.md`, `test_ito_calculus.py` |
| **B.5 Heavy-Tailed Distributions & Financial Risk** | `[CORE]` | Extreme Value Theory, power-law tail index $\alpha$, Fréchet/Gumbel domains | Hill estimator for tail index $\alpha$; subexponential tail simulation vs Gaussian risk models (Phase 4) | Synthetic Pareto/Student-t and empirical financial crash data (2008, 2020) | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` Hill estimator on synthetic Pareto recovers true $\alpha$ within $3/\sqrt{k}$ bound | Hill plot stability region, tail risk underestimation quantified | `hill_plot_tail_index.png`, `heavy_tail_consequences.md` |
| **B.6 Markov Chains: Discrete & Continuous** | `[CORE]` | Perron-Frobenius theorem, ergodicity, Chapman-Kolmogorov equations | Transition probability matrix estimation for market regimes (Bull, Bear, Flat); stationary distribution | Historical volatility/return discretized states | `[MATH_INVARIANT]` Row stochasticity $\sum_j P_{ij} = 1$; stationary state invariant $\pi P = \pi$ | Convergence rate to stationary distribution (spectral gap) | `markov_transition_heatmap.png`, `test_markov_chains.py` |
| **B.7 Monte Carlo Variance Reduction** | `[CORE]` | Law of Total Variance, correlation, change of measure | Antithetic variates, Control variates (using Black-Scholes asset price), Importance sampling (Phase 2) | Synthetic risk-neutral path simulations | `[STAT_VALIDATION]` Measured VRF reported with asymptotic standard error; pilot sanity checks verified | Variance Reduction Factor (VRF), computational efficiency ratio (VRF $\times$ Speedup) | `variance_reduction_comparison.png`, `variance_reduction_table.json` |
| **B.8 Numerical Methods for Financial Models** | `[CORE]` | Numerical differentiation, root finding (Brent's method), numerical integration | Implied volatility root-finder via Brent's method; Crank-Nicolson finite-difference PDE solver | Option market price quotes (synthetic & sample historical) | `[NUM_TOLERANCE]` Root finder round-trip: $|\text{BS}(\sigma_{\text{implied}}) - C_{\text{market}}| < 10^{-8}$ | Finite-difference grid stability and convergence rate | `implied_vol_surface.png`, `test_numerical_solvers.py` |

